stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Received
  Received --> Extracted: attachment parsed
  Extracted --> Exception: missing or low-confidence data
  Extracted --> Matching: required fields valid
  Matching --> Exception: duplicate, missing PO, variance, or GR shortfall
  Matching --> Matched: controls pass
  Matched --> Approved: approval policy satisfied
  Exception --> Approved: human approves with comment
  Exception --> Rejected: human rejects
  Approved --> Posted: idempotent ERP call succeeds
  Posted --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]

